					},
					"usage": "Spit Poison",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 4
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Spit Poison (14): A guardian naga can spit its poison at any target within 100 yards. If the spittle hits bare skin of a living being, the being must make an immediate HT-2 roll or take 1d toxic damage. Every 10 seconds for 4 more cycles the victim must make another HT-2 roll to resist or take the same amount of damage. After losing 1/3 HP to this poison, the victim gets a -3 penalty to HT until he heals above this threshold. Each spit costs 1 FP."
				}
			]
